{% doc %}
  Loads the two brand faces.

  Archivo and IBM Plex Mono are pinned here rather than routed through Shopify's
  font picker: the design uses Archivo 800 and 900 for display type and the tile
  year, and the picker cannot serve that weight range. `brand-tokens` maps both
  families onto Horizon's four font slots.

  The css2 endpoint splits its @font-face rules by unicode-range, so a latin-only
  page only ever downloads the latin subset — no subset parameter needed.
{% enddoc %}

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link
  rel="preconnect"
  href="https://fonts.gstatic.com"
  crossorigin
>
<link
  rel="stylesheet"
  href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500;600&display=swap"
>
